# Live second-host evidence (claim gate)

Copy to `reports/live_second_host.json` only after elevated wevtutil on a **second
physical Windows host** (not Docker lab, not the author laptop alone).

```json
{
  "pass": true,
  "source": "wevtutil",
  "host_id": "DESKTOP-OTHER",
  "security_events_seen": true,
  "run_dir": "runs/live-host-2",
  "note": "Elevated corvex sensor-windows --require-live --follow; sensor_status.source=wevtutil"
}
```

`source` must be `wevtutil`. Fixture / offline_lab_replay does not count.
